813f793d/67a5cbc1208131b4daf861e7_logo-teamviewer.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="companies-logo__image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/67a5cbc24b14dbcf70bc1daa_logo-tonies.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="companies-logo__image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/67a5cbc04853dcb34a220853_logo-easypark.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="companies-logo__image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/67a9bc0d8ed2c3b8a1da59c4_logo-apo.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="companies-logo__image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6926e66924c7667d82e3f1ca_remerge-logo%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6926e66924c7667d82e3f1ca_remerge-logo%20(1)-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6926e66924c7667d82e3f1ca_remerge-logo%20(1).webp 970w" alt="" class="companies-logo__image is-remerge"/></div></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
   .companies-logo__wrapper {
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .companies-logo__track {
    animation: marquee 40s linear infinite;
    white-space: nowrap;
    width: max-content;
  }

  .companies-logo__image {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @keyframes marquee {
    from {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }
  </style></div></div></section><section class="everything-you-need__section"><div class="new-container padding-global"><div class="everything-you-need__wrapper"><div class="everything-you-need__header"><h2 class="everything-you-need__title">See every tool, license, <br/>and renewal in <span class="text-span-102">one place.</span></h2></div><div class="everything-you-need__row"><div class="everything-you-need__row-content"><h3 class="everything-you-need__row-title">Discover every tool automatically.</h3><p class="everything-you-need__row-text">Sastrify connects to your systems (IDP, Browser, ERP) and automatically discovers every software tool in use. Then it maps ownership, usage, renewals, and spend - giving you a single, accurate software inventory in minutes.<br/></p><a href="https://sastrify.com/platform" class="btn-learn-more is--large-copy w-button">Learn more      →</a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/69083fa360fed0ad60672f41_card.webp" loading="lazy" width="627" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 627px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/69083fa360fed0ad60672f41_card-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/69083fa360fed0ad60672f41_card-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/69083fa360fed0ad60672f41_card-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/69083fa360fed0ad60672f41_card.webp 1254w" class="everything-you-need__image"/></div><div class="everything-you-need__row--reverse"><div class="everything-you-need__row-content"><h3 class="everything-you-need__row-title">Control access and license usage.</h3><p class="everything-you-need__row-text">Manage permissions, seats, and ownership automatically. Sastrify right-sizes seats, and handles renewals so nothing slips through the cracks - keeping your software stack secure, compliant, and efficient.<br/></p><a href="https://www.sastrify.com/platform" class="btn-learn-more is--large-copy w-button">Discover      →</a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card.webp" loading="lazy" width="627" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 627px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card-p-2000.webp 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/690840f4fa6875df88ba03c6_card.webp 2508w" class="everything-you-need__image"/></div><div class="everything-you-need__row"><div class="everything-you-need__row-content"><h3 class="everything-you-need__row-title">Automate renewals and workflows.</h3><p class="everything-you-need__row-text">Never miss another renewal or chase a contract again. Sastrify automates renewal alerts, approvals, and vendor tracking so your IT and Procurement teams can stay proactive without manual effort.<br/></p><a href="https://www.sastrify.com/paas" class="btn-learn-more is--large-copy w-button">Learn more      →</a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6908a52eebbe1d4a9ef4cbfd_c653aa8d4d1af6eaf67bfef39ad9e60b_Untitled%20design%20%281%29.svg" loading="lazy" width="627" height="100" alt="" class="everything-you-need__image"/></div><div class="everything-you-need__row--reverse"><div class="everything-you-need__row-content"><h3 class="everything-you-need__row-title">Benchmark and optimize software spend.</h3><p class="everything-you-need__row-text">Sastrify benchmarks every software contract against thousands of live data points. Our AI suggests fair pricing, renewal timing, and negotiation levers - helping you secure better deals.</p><a href="https://www.sastrify.com/saas-spend-control" class="btn-learn-more is--large-copy w-button">See how it works      →</a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/681db2c987fb811e8e6562c9_card.webp" loading="lazy" width="627" height="Auto" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/681db2c987fb811e8e6562c9_card-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/681db2c987fb811e8e6562c9_card-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/681db2c987fb811e8e6562c9_card-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/681db2c987fb811e8e6562c9_card.webp 1254w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 627px" class="everything-you-need__image"/></div><div class="everything-you-need__row"><div class="everything-you-need__row-content"><h3 class="everything-you-need__row-title">Stay audit-ready with zero manual effort.</h3><p class="everything-you-need__row-text">Sastrify auto-documents compliance status for each vendor, attaches certificates, and generates audit reports with one click. Your security, procurement, and finance teams stay aligned - and audit prep goes from days to minutes for DORA, NIS2, the AI Act, and more.<br/></p><a href="https://www.sastrify.com/grc-ai-act-compliance" class="btn-learn-more is--large-copy w-button">Discover      →</a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6908408c9c5e4131bd629720_card-1.webp" loading="lazy" width="627" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 627px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6908408c9c5e4131bd629720_card-1-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6908408c9c5e4131bd629720_card-1-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6908408c9c5e4131bd629720_card-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/6908408c9c5e4131bd629720_card-1.webp 1254w" class="everything-you-need__image"/></div></div></div><div class="paas_wrapper-3"><div class="paas-section__header"><h2 class="software-management__title-copy">Visibility that <span class="text-span-103">saves time and money <br/>‍</span>from day one. <br/></h2></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-21"><div id="w-node-bf54611b-ae49-8409-7cfd-2ec83305116a-04d36ed4" class="tile-paas"><div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-paas"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e578a162123d0f30ee00df_icons8-360-100.png" loading="lazy" width="51" alt=""/><div class="text-block-393-4">Full visibility and control.</div></div><div class="w-layout-hflex"><h4 class="numer_paas_tile">90%</h4><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e5774c38cc73b2c62c09a3_icons8-up-100%20(3).png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="image-4180"/></div><div class="text-block-360">of vendors and spend under management within 7 days. Eliminate Shadow IT, enforce compliance, and unlock AI-powered monitoring across your software landscape fast.<br/></div></div><div id="w-node-bf54611b-ae49-8409-7cfd-2ec833051152-04d36ed4" class="tile-paas"><div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-paas"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e5788d62123d0f30edfa73_icons8-clock-100%20(2).png" loading="lazy" width="51" alt=""/><div class="text-block-393-2">Lean teams, less manual work.</div></div><div class="w-layout-hflex"><h4 class="numer_paas_tile">6h</h4><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e57ca928a4d6850544483a_icons8-plus-100.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="image-4180"/></div><div class="text-block-360">time back per week: We handle intake, negotiations &amp; vendor management - you keep the steering wheel while we handle the busywork.<br/></div></div><div id="w-node-bf54611b-ae49-8409-7cfd-2ec833051146-04d36ed4" class="tile-paas-1"><div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-paas"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e574914851c92573731534_icons8-dollar-100%20(1).png" loading="lazy" width="54" alt="" class="image-4179"/><div class="text-block-393-1">Proven savings, guaranteed.</div></div><div class="w-layout-hflex"><h4 class="numer_paas_tile">30%</h4><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e5774c398ac1c52b65e951_icons8-up-100.png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="image-4180"/></div><div class="text-block-360">average savings across your software landscape. Stop overspending with $6B+ in benchmark data.<br/></div></div><div id="w-node-bf54611b-ae49-8409-7cfd-2ec83305115e-04d36ed4" class="tile-paas"><div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-paas"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e57808fc2f8a47de7c9817_icons8-artificial-intelligence-100%20(2).png" loading="lazy" width="51" alt=""/><div class="text-block-393">AI-powered intelligence.</div></div><div class="w-layout-hflex"><h4 class="numer_paas_tile">15k</h4><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61926ae506154e2b813f793d/68e57ca92898506be80d8b50_icons8-plus-100%20(1).png" loading="lazy" width="40" alt="" class="image-4180"/></div><div class="text-block-360">vendors auto-mapped and benchmarked. Our AI continuously detects inefficiencies, predicts costs, and keeps every software dollar accountable.<br/></div></div></div><div class="popup-block"><a href="#" fs-modal-element="open-99" id="w-node-_9d915cf6-809e-ac5e-6007-e9a34de9c137-4de9c136" class="btn-bottom-center is--large w-button">Get a Demo</a><section fs-modal-animation="fade" fs-modal-element="modal-99" class="popup_overlay-redesign"><div class="new-container padding-global is-pop-up"><div class="right-shape-hero__form is-pop-up"><h2 class="righ